  "text": " As opposed to the Walgreens pharmacist who I called the other day to get a life-saving medication for a patient who was in danger of having a miscarriage, she needed her progesterone. I called it in that morning and she went in to get the medication to save her unborn child and an hour went and they still hadn't listened to the voicemail. Two hours went. At 10 o'clock I called the pharmacist. I said, why have you not listened to the voicemail? This woman needs this baby needs this medication to save this baby. Oh, I'm sorry, Dr. Littell. We've been swamped giving COVID vaccines all morning. I don't have time to listen to the voicemails and that's not the first time I've heard that. All right, but what this other pharmacist who's in the audience today gave me was what is received by the pharmacist when they get the COVID vaccines is this educational piece which says intentionally blank you open it up and it's an entirely blank piece of paper. This is what they call informed consent for the COVID vaccine in 2021.",
